  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Cut zucchini into bite-sized chunks. Finely chop garlic. Trim baby broccoli. Halve any thicker stalks of baby broccoli lengthways. Drain and rinse cannellini beans.\n• In a large saucepan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over high heat. Cook zucchini, baby broccoli and soffritto mix, stirring occasionally, until softened, 4-5 minutes.\n• Add cannellini beans and cook, until softened, 1-2 minutes (Cook in batches if your pan is getting crowded).",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67ff1dc9bf4d5de43bbf3d87/step-428a4b00.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Add Mediterranean seasoning, the plain flour and half the garlic and cook, stirring, until fragrant, 1 minute.\n• Stir in light cooking cream, vegetable stock powder(see ingredients) and the water.\n• Reduce heat to medium, then cover with a lid and simmer, until thickened, 2-3 minutes.\n• In a large frying pan, heat enough olive oil to coat base over medium-high heat.\n• Cook plant-based crumbed chicken until golden and heated through, 2-3 minutes on each side. Transfer to a paper towel-lined plate.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67ff1dc9bf4d5de43bbf3d87/step-e319ec10.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, cut bake-at-home ciabatta into slices. Toast or grill ciabatta to your liking.\n• In a small microwave-safe bowl, microwave the butter and remaining garlic in 10 second bursts, until melted and fragrant.\n• Brush garlic butter over ciabatta. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67ff1dc9bf4d5de43bbf3d87/step-0b924a20.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Slice plant-based crumbed chicken.\n• Divide creamy Mediterranean bean stew between bowls.\n• Top with plant-based crumbed chicken and basil pesto.\n• Serve with garlic ciabatta dippers. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67ff1dc9bf4d5de43bbf3d87/step-a3c59330.jpg"
    }
  ]
